        "output": "{\"action\":\"stop\",\"parent\":\"4cf4d14a048db114b44090947469317d886dcabec3f49000676b385eea828946\",\"hypothesis\":\"Retain the current skill. Its instructions implement the specified seven-day policy, and the observed exploration output correctly handles legal hold, younger records, approved eligibility at age 7, and unapproved eligibility. The supplied evidence reveals no relevant defect, so no change is justified.\",\"edits\":[]}",
