        "status": "completed",
        "output": "{\"action\":\"stop\",\"parent\":\"13e07541eaab24c6bd2d9fc528a575adaa40c15bdd62e189e7afe46c7235ca13\",\"hypothesis\":\"The supplied downstream evidence does not support a useful change to this method's diagnosis, candidate construction, or stopping behavior. On retention-migration, H0 identified the obsolete policy, produced candidate 8353e4f805484e0ced3159b1f0bb86c40fc6ed447ab577eff7d2c507a2470539, corrected every observed changed-policy classification, and preserved every separately tested working behavior; the candidate was accepted. On preserve-working-skill, the starting target already passed every supplied check and no candidate edits were proposed. Its outer score of 0 measures no increase in successful cases, not a demonstrated defect in preservation or stopping. Both tasks therefore reach the observed quality ceiling. The retained timeout observations confound context size, scheduling, and elapsed allowances, so they do not establish a text-method defect or measurable cost benefit. Retain H0 without edits. This is a justified stopping decision for these known synthetic tasks, not evidence of broad effectiveness, held-out transfer, or sustained self-improvement.\",\"edits\":[]}",
